{
  "set": "bench-1",
  "schema": 1,
  "decisions": [
    "The table in section 22 of the spec, \"What runs\", in page order; (Q) is \"list\": \"quick\", and the Full list is every metric.",
    "Tolerances are Compare's defaults before this set: 3% for the browser benchmarks, 2% for 7-Zip, 5% for the rest.",
    "The web benchmarks, Chrome for Testing for Omarchy, 7-Zip for Omarchy and the H.264 clip are the files the lab pinned before this set, at the same sha256.",
    "A file the lab builds itself (\"lab_built\") holds the placeholder until a Lab release publishes it; every other unpinned file and version holds it until the set is timed on the slowest Lab-owned Mac. A set holding a placeholder is never the current set.",
    "llama.cpp's prompt and generation counts are llama-bench's own defaults, 512 and 128 tokens."
  ],
